{"id":"fd4c46cdc1516501","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-proofterm.md","title":"带源目标的证明项语法","display":"df-proofterm — 带源目标的证明项语法","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-proofterm","aliases":["56-df-proofterm"],"display":"df-proofterm — 带源目标的证明项语法","depends_on":["[[56-df-redex-occurrence]]"],"source_section":"§8.2 Definitions 8.2.18–8.2.19; Remark 8.2.21","source_printed_pages":"322–324","source_ocr_blocks":[343,344,345],"source_statement_status":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr; typed-open-term-coding-local","source_proof_status":"local-structural-derivation-in-Remark; not-machine-formalized"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-proofterm"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-proofterm</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-proofterm — 带源目标的证明项语法"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"707725c5abd5d9ca\" href=\"?note=707725c5abd5d9ca\" title=\"56-df-redex-occurrence\">56-df-redex-occurrence</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§8.2 Definitions 8.2.18–8.2.19; Remark 8.2.21"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"322–324"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>343</span><span>344</span><span>345</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr; typed-open-term-coding-local"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"local-structural-derivation-in-Remark; not-machine-formalized"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定普通TRS及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar}),V,R\">\\(T,\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar}),V,R\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"707725c5abd5d9ca\" href=\"?note=707725c5abd5d9ca\" title=\"56-df-redex-occurrence\">56-df-redex-occurrence</a>。每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda=(l,r)\\in R\">\\(\\lambda=(l,r)\\in R\\)</span> 固定无重复枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol x_\\lambda=(x_{\\lambda,1},\\ldots,x_{\\lambda,k_\\lambda})\">\\(\\boldsymbol x_\\lambda=(x_{\\lambda,1},\\ldots,x_{\\lambda,k_\\lambda})\\)</span>，其值域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Var}(l)\">\\(\\operatorname{Var}(l)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf X,\\mathsf F,\\mathsf L,\\mathsf C\">\\(\\mathsf X,\\mathsf F,\\mathsf L,\\mathsf C\\)</span> 是互异带标签的有限树构造器；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> 表示单调集合算子的最小不动点。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal J_R\">\\(\\mathcal J_R\\)</span> 是以下规则生成的最小三元组集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi,\\psi,\\phi_i\">\\(\\phi,\\psi,\\phi_i\\)</span> 是其第一分量参数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_{\\lambda,\\boldsymbol s}(x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}s_i&amp;x=x_{\\lambda,i},\\\\x&amp;x\\notin\\operatorname{Var}(l),\\end{cases}\\qquad (\\lambda=(l,r)\\in R,\\ \\boldsymbol s\\in T^{k_\\lambda}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\sigma_{\\lambda,\\boldsymbol s}(x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}s_i&amp;x=x_{\\lambda,i},\\\\x&amp;x\\notin\\operatorname{Var}(l),\\end{cases}\\qquad (\\lambda=(l,r)\\in R,\\ \\boldsymbol s\\in T^{k_\\lambda}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal Q_R\\coloneqq\\mu A\\;\\left(\\{\\mathsf X(x):x\\in V\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf F(f;\\phi_1,\\ldots,\\phi_n):f\\in\\mathcal F,\\ n=\\operatorname{ar}(f),\\ \\boldsymbol\\phi\\in A^n\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\phi_1,\\ldots,\\phi_{k_\\lambda}):\\lambda\\in R,\\ \\boldsymbol\\phi\\in A^{k_\\lambda}\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf C(\\phi,\\psi):\\phi,\\psi\\in A\\}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal Q_R\\coloneqq\\mu A\\;\\left(\\{\\mathsf X(x):x\\in V\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf F(f;\\phi_1,\\ldots,\\phi_n):f\\in\\mathcal F,\\ n=\\operatorname{ar}(f),\\ \\boldsymbol\\phi\\in A^n\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\phi_1,\\ldots,\\phi_{k_\\lambda}):\\lambda\\in R,\\ \\boldsymbol\\phi\\in A^{k_\\lambda}\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf C(\\phi,\\psi):\\phi,\\psi\\in A\\}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{x\\in V}{(\\mathsf X(x),x,x)\\in\\mathcal J_R}\\qquad\\frac{f\\in\\mathcal F\\quad n=\\operatorname{ar}(f)\\quad (\\phi_i,s_i,t_i)\\in\\mathcal J_R\\ (1\\le i\\le n)}{(\\mathsf F(f;\\boldsymbol\\phi),f(\\boldsymbol s),f(\\boldsymbol t))\\in\\mathcal J_R}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{x\\in V}{(\\mathsf X(x),x,x)\\in\\mathcal J_R}\\qquad\\frac{f\\in\\mathcal F\\quad n=\\operatorname{ar}(f)\\quad (\\phi_i,s_i,t_i)\\in\\mathcal J_R\\ (1\\le i\\le n)}{(\\mathsf F(f;\\boldsymbol\\phi),f(\\boldsymbol s),f(\\boldsymbol t))\\in\\mathcal J_R}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{\\lambda=(l,r)\\in R\\quad(\\phi_i,s_i,t_i)\\in\\mathcal J_R\\ (1\\le i\\le k_\\lambda)}{(\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\boldsymbol\\phi),l\\sigma_{\\lambda,\\boldsymbol s},r\\sigma_{\\lambda,\\boldsymbol t})\\in\\mathcal J_R}\\qquad\\frac{(\\phi,s,t)\\in\\mathcal J_R\\quad(\\psi,t,z)\\in\\mathcal J_R}{(\\mathsf C(\\phi,\\psi),s,z)\\in\\mathcal J_R}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{\\lambda=(l,r)\\in R\\quad(\\phi_i,s_i,t_i)\\in\\mathcal J_R\\ (1\\le i\\le k_\\lambda)}{(\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\boldsymbol\\phi),l\\sigma_{\\lambda,\\boldsymbol s},r\\sigma_{\\lambda,\\boldsymbol t})\\in\\mathcal J_R}\\qquad\\frac{(\\phi,s,t)\\in\\mathcal J_R\\quad(\\psi,t,z)\\in\\mathcal J_R}{(\\mathsf C(\\phi,\\psi),s,z)\\in\\mathcal J_R}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G_R:\\mathcal P(\\mathcal Q_R\\times T\\times T)\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal Q_R\\times T\\times T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G_R:\\mathcal P(\\mathcal Q_R\\times T\\times T)\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal Q_R\\times T\\times T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G_R(J)\\coloneqq\\{(\\mathsf X(x),x,x):x\\in V\\}\\cup\\{(\\mathsf F(f;\\boldsymbol\\phi),f(\\boldsymbol s),f(\\boldsymbol t)):f\\in\\mathcal F,\\ n=\\operatorname{ar}(f),\\ \\boldsymbol\\phi\\in\\mathcal Q_R^n,\\ \\boldsymbol s,\\boldsymbol t\\in T^n,\\ \\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;((\\phi_i,s_i,t_i)\\in J)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G_R(J)\\coloneqq\\{(\\mathsf X(x),x,x):x\\in V\\}\\cup\\{(\\mathsf F(f;\\boldsymbol\\phi),f(\\boldsymbol s),f(\\boldsymbol t)):f\\in\\mathcal F,\\ n=\\operatorname{ar}(f),\\ \\boldsymbol\\phi\\in\\mathcal Q_R^n,\\ \\boldsymbol s,\\boldsymbol t\\in T^n,\\ \\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;((\\phi_i,s_i,t_i)\\in J)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\hspace{1em}\\cup\\{(\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\boldsymbol\\phi),l\\sigma_{\\lambda,\\boldsymbol s},r\\sigma_{\\lambda,\\boldsymbol t}):\\lambda=(l,r)\\in R,\\ \\boldsymbol\\phi\\in\\mathcal Q_R^{k_\\lambda},\\ \\boldsymbol s,\\boldsymbol t\\in T^{k_\\lambda},\\ \\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k_\\lambda\\}\\;((\\phi_i,s_i,t_i)\\in J)\\}\\cup\\{(\\mathsf C(\\phi,\\psi),s,z):\\exists t\\in T\\;((\\phi,s,t)\\in J\\land(\\psi,t,z)\\in J)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\hspace{1em}\\cup\\{(\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\boldsymbol\\phi),l\\sigma_{\\lambda,\\boldsymbol s},r\\sigma_{\\lambda,\\boldsymbol t}):\\lambda=(l,r)\\in R,\\ \\boldsymbol\\phi\\in\\mathcal Q_R^{k_\\lambda},\\ \\boldsymbol s,\\boldsymbol t\\in T^{k_\\lambda},\\ \\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k_\\lambda\\}\\;((\\phi_i,s_i,t_i)\\in J)\\}\\cup\\{(\\mathsf C(\\phi,\\psi),s,z):\\exists t\\in T\\;((\\phi,s,t)\\in J\\land(\\psi,t,z)\\in J)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal J_R\\coloneqq\\mu J\\;G_R(J).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal J_R\\coloneqq\\mu J\\;G_R(J).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PT}_R\\coloneqq\\{\\phi\\in\\mathcal Q_R:\\exists s,t\\in T\\;((\\phi,s,t)\\in\\mathcal J_R)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PT}_R\\coloneqq\\{\\phi\\in\\mathcal Q_R:\\exists s,t\\in T\\;((\\phi,s,t)\\in\\mathcal J_R)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S_R,T_R:\\operatorname{PT}_R\\to T.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S_R,T_R:\\operatorname{PT}_R\\to T.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S_R(\\phi)\\coloneqq s,\\quad T_R(\\phi)\\coloneqq t\\quad((\\phi,s,t)\\in\\mathcal J_R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S_R(\\phi)\\coloneqq s,\\quad T_R(\\phi)\\coloneqq t\\quad((\\phi,s,t)\\in\\mathcal J_R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Id}_R(x)\\coloneqq\\mathsf X(x),\\qquad\\operatorname{Id}_R(f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n))\\coloneqq\\mathsf F(f;\\operatorname{Id}_R(t_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{Id}_R(t_n)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Id}_R(x)\\coloneqq\\mathsf X(x),\\qquad\\operatorname{Id}_R(f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n))\\coloneqq\\mathsf F(f;\\operatorname{Id}_R(t_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{Id}_R(t_n)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\phi\\bullet\\psi\\coloneqq\\mathsf C(\\phi,\\psi)\\quad(\\phi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R,\\ T_R(\\phi)=S_R(\\psi)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\phi\\bullet\\psi\\coloneqq\\mathsf C(\\phi,\\psi)\\quad(\\phi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R,\\ T_R(\\phi)=S_R(\\psi)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书将变量视作常量处理开放项；这里用互不相交的构造标签显式实现刚性变量恒等证明。规则构造器的子证明同时改变规则变量实例，因而不是只在恒等参数上应用重写规则。原始树中可以出现不匹配的组合，PT只保留可类型化树。源目标的唯一性由构造树归纳：四种标签互异，函数、规则的子三元组唯一决定两端，组合还要求中间项一致；故S、T确为函数。Id的两端均为原项。同名规则用规则项对作为身份，与本目录具体红项接口一致。本定义不把可归约项直接等同于证明对象。</p>\n<p>来源：用户提供的Terese (2003)本地DjVu；书页为印刷页，OCR块按U+001F从1编号。源文件及规范化文字哈希已与前轮重核。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-redex-occurrence","status":"resolved","id":"707725c5abd5d9ca","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-redex-occurrence]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-redex-occurrence","status":"resolved","id":"707725c5abd5d9ca","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定普通TRS及 $T,\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar}),V,R$，见 [[56-df-redex-occurrence]]。每个 $\\lambda=(l,r)\\in R$ 固定无重复枚举 $\\boldsymbol x_\\lambda=(x_{\\lambda,1},\\ldots,x_{\\lambda,k_\\lambda})$，其值域为 $\\operatorname{Var}(l)$。$\\mathsf X,\\mathsf F,\\mathsf L,\\mathsf C$ 是互异带标签的有限树构造器；$\\mu$ 表示单调集合算子的最小不动点。$\\mathcal J_R$ 是以下规则生成的最小三元组集合；$\\phi,\\psi,\\phi_i$ 是其第一分量参数。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T,\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar}),V,R","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda=(l,r)\\in R","display":false},{"tex":"\\boldsymbol x_\\lambda=(x_{\\lambda,1},\\ldots,x_{\\lambda,k_\\lambda})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Var}(l)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf X,\\mathsf F,\\mathsf L,\\mathsf C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal J_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi,\\psi,\\phi_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma_{\\lambda,\\boldsymbol s}(x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}s_i&x=x_{\\lambda,i},\\\\x&x\\notin\\operatorname{Var}(l),\\end{cases}\\qquad (\\lambda=(l,r)\\in R,\\ \\boldsymbol s\\in T^{k_\\lambda}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal Q_R\\coloneqq\\mu A\\;\\left(\\{\\mathsf X(x):x\\in V\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf F(f;\\phi_1,\\ldots,\\phi_n):f\\in\\mathcal F,\\ n=\\operatorname{ar}(f),\\ \\boldsymbol\\phi\\in A^n\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\phi_1,\\ldots,\\phi_{k_\\lambda}):\\lambda\\in R,\\ \\boldsymbol\\phi\\in A^{k_\\lambda}\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf C(\\phi,\\psi):\\phi,\\psi\\in A\\}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\frac{x\\in V}{(\\mathsf X(x),x,x)\\in\\mathcal J_R}\\qquad\\frac{f\\in\\mathcal F\\quad n=\\operatorname{ar}(f)\\quad (\\phi_i,s_i,t_i)\\in\\mathcal J_R\\ (1\\le i\\le n)}{(\\mathsf F(f;\\boldsymbol\\phi),f(\\boldsymbol s),f(\\boldsymbol t))\\in\\mathcal J_R}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\frac{\\lambda=(l,r)\\in R\\quad(\\phi_i,s_i,t_i)\\in\\mathcal J_R\\ (1\\le i\\le k_\\lambda)}{(\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\boldsymbol\\phi),l\\sigma_{\\lambda,\\boldsymbol s},r\\sigma_{\\lambda,\\boldsymbol t})\\in\\mathcal J_R}\\qquad\\frac{(\\phi,s,t)\\in\\mathcal J_R\\quad(\\psi,t,z)\\in\\mathcal J_R}{(\\mathsf C(\\phi,\\psi),s,z)\\in\\mathcal J_R}.","display":true},{"tex":"G_R:\\mathcal P(\\mathcal Q_R\\times T\\times T)\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal Q_R\\times T\\times T).","display":true},{"tex":"G_R(J)\\coloneqq\\{(\\mathsf X(x),x,x):x\\in V\\}\\cup\\{(\\mathsf F(f;\\boldsymbol\\phi),f(\\boldsymbol s),f(\\boldsymbol t)):f\\in\\mathcal F,\\ n=\\operatorname{ar}(f),\\ \\boldsymbol\\phi\\in\\mathcal Q_R^n,\\ \\boldsymbol s,\\boldsymbol t\\in T^n,\\ \\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;((\\phi_i,s_i,t_i)\\in J)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\hspace{1em}\\cup\\{(\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\boldsymbol\\phi),l\\sigma_{\\lambda,\\boldsymbol s},r\\sigma_{\\lambda,\\boldsymbol t}):\\lambda=(l,r)\\in R,\\ \\boldsymbol\\phi\\in\\mathcal Q_R^{k_\\lambda},\\ \\boldsymbol s,\\boldsymbol t\\in T^{k_\\lambda},\\ \\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k_\\lambda\\}\\;((\\phi_i,s_i,t_i)\\in J)\\}\\cup\\{(\\mathsf C(\\phi,\\psi),s,z):\\exists t\\in T\\;((\\phi,s,t)\\in J\\land(\\psi,t,z)\\in J)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal J_R\\coloneqq\\mu J\\;G_R(J).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PT}_R\\coloneqq\\{\\phi\\in\\mathcal Q_R:\\exists s,t\\in T\\;((\\phi,s,t)\\in\\mathcal J_R)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"S_R,T_R:\\operatorname{PT}_R\\to T.","display":true},{"tex":"S_R(\\phi)\\coloneqq s,\\quad T_R(\\phi)\\coloneqq t\\quad((\\phi,s,t)\\in\\mathcal J_R).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Id}_R(x)\\coloneqq\\mathsf X(x),\\qquad\\operatorname{Id}_R(f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n))\\coloneqq\\mathsf F(f;\\operatorname{Id}_R(t_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{Id}_R(t_n)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\phi\\bullet\\psi\\coloneqq\\mathsf C(\\phi,\\psi)\\quad(\\phi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R,\\ T_R(\\phi)=S_R(\\psi)).","display":true}],"bytes":4343,"backlinks":[{"id":"c273fed319bca9e3","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"使用 [[56-df-proofterm]]、[[56-df-labelled-reduction]] 的接口。具体步嵌入 $e_R$ 的局部参数为 $a=(s,u,t)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R$、$u=(p,l,r)$、$\\lambda=(l,r)$，并取 $\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,V)$ 满足 $s|_p=l\\sigma$；匹配接口见 [[56-df-redex-occurrence]]。$\\operatorname{Ctx}(\\Sigma,V)$ 见 [[56-df-context]]；$\\widehat C$ 在唯一孔处保留参数，其余变量及函数用证明项的恒等构造。路径构造独立以 $\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R$ 为局部参数；上下文嵌入独立以 $\\phi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R$、$C\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}(\\Sigma,V)$ 为局部参数。"},{"id":"b93c21fedffb4c4c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"使用 [[56-df-proofterm]] 的类型化证明项。$\\theta:V\\to\\operatorname{PT}_R$，$q\\in T$。$S_R\\theta,T_R\\theta$ 是下文定义的变量替换，项上的应用见 [[56-df-substitution-application]]。规则实例化的两个定义式局部取 $\\lambda=(l,r)\\in R$、$\\boldsymbol\\phi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R^{k_\\lambda}$；一般的 $\\widehat\\theta$、$S_R\\theta$、$T_R\\theta$ 独立以已给定的 $\\theta$ 为参数。"},{"id":"613e5d5bb6ec9bee","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PT}_R,\\mathsf X,\\mathsf F,\\mathsf L,\\mathsf C,S_R,T_R,\\boldsymbol x_\\lambda,k_\\lambda$ 采用 [[56-df-proofterm]]；其变量集 $V$ 在此记为 $\\mathcal V$，位置构造器仍为 $V(p)$。规则解释分支局部取 $\\lambda=(l,r)\\in R$，并沿用其枚举 $\\boldsymbol x_\\lambda=(x_{\\lambda,1},\\ldots,x_{\\lambda,k_\\lambda})$。$\\operatorname{TPos},E,V,\\epsilon,\\cdot,\\operatorname{FPos}$ 见 [[56-df-typed-redex-pattern]]。$m\\in\\{\\mathrm d,\\mathrm s\\}$ 是二元模式参数，$s,t\\in T$。变量构造分支局部取 $x\\in\\mathcal V$；函数构造分支局部取 $f\\in\\mathcal F$、$n=\\operatorname{ar}(f)$。关系复合方向从左向右。$A_i$ 分别是第i个子证明项的源、目标位置间的关系；$z,w$ 为有类型位置。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-112","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-proofterm.md]]"}],"outgoing":["707725c5abd5d9ca"]}